Z||000014||loafer87gt||04-17-2000||12:56 PM||||I have been super lucky with the cops! Three years ago me and three of my buddies had our cars out after the summer car show in our city. We all ended up racing on a long city  straightaway and got busted by the cops. I was clocked at 140 KPH and my buddy in the Iroc was going faster than me, I think my brother in his civic was behind us and my other buddies roadrunner was way ahead! To make a long story short, the cop told us that we would have our licenses revoked if he gaves us a ticket, so he gave me and the guy in the Iroc a warning that if we ever roll through a yellow light, fail to signal at an intersection, or are even speeding 5 KPH over the limit he will ticket us each time. I think he was a bit sympathetic towards us because everyone else in the city was doing some stunting after the show showing off their wheels. Ever since that incident I realize how lucky I was and haven't done anything as stupid as that again. I'll right it off as being young and foolish.||||reg||3
